  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CBSI-Jamaica-ESF-Monitoring Evaluation and Learning Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">(State Western Hemisphere Regional):  .USAID recognizes that strong monitoring, evaluation, and learning (MEL) practices are critical to improving outcomes in youth violence prevention activities.  Through the Jamaica Monitoring Evaluation and Learning (JAMEL) support for the CBSI activity, USAID will provide dedicated support to develop the MEL capacity of local government and NGOs that work to prevent youth crime and violence in Jamaica.  USAID will provide technical assistance on how to develop MEL plans, identify suitable indicators and set targets, institute monitoring protocols, and adapt activity implementation based on monitoring data.  The activity will also facilitate annual assessments to inform the Mission&apos;s and CBSI&apos;s learning agendas for youth crime and violence programming..</narrative>
  </description>
